{
 "encounter_id": "00568",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good morning. Mr Gopal Rathore, correct? And you are...?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Good morning, doctor. I am Sunita, I stay with him as his carer. Yes, he is Mr Rathore."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, yes, Gopal Rathore. You know, the lift downstairs was not working, so we took the stairs very slowly, and that itself shows the problem."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let us start there, then. What is the problem?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I am more breathless than last winter, doctor. Last winter also I was breathless, but this time it is more, and my grandson's wedding is in March, so I told Sunita..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "One thing at a time, please. How long has this extra breathlessness been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two weeks, I think. Only two weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Three weeks, sir. I am counting from the day you stopped walking to the park."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Two, three weeks. So roughly two to three weeks, let us say. Any cough with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, cough also, every morning, with some white phlegm. That one is old, it is always there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "White phlegm, fine. Any wheezing, any whistling sound in the chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Wheezing, yes, at night, when I lie down. I hear it myself, and Sunita also hears."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain, doctor. That I would have told you immediately."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Coughing up any blood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood, no. Only the white phlegm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Any swelling in your legs or ankles?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swelling in my legs, doctor. These legs are the same as always."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Sir, his ankles are swollen in the evenings, doctor. When I take off his socks they leave deep marks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. We will come back to that. Now medicines. Which inhalers and tablets are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tiotropium inhaler, once a day in the morning. And the blue inhaler, salbutamol, when I am breathless, which is many times now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "One small white tablet for the pressure. The name I cannot recall, my daughter wrote it somewhere. Sunita, what is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I am sorry, doctor, only the box has the name and it is at home. White, small, round, once in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any other health problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "COPD, ten years now. Also high blood pressure, and diabetes, controlled by diet only. Arthritis in the knees also, that is why I do not walk much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cataract operation, five years ago, left eye. And my appendix, in 1988."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, penicillin. I get a rash all over. A doctor in 1990 told me never to take it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. In the family, any chest or heart problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father died of a heart attack at sixty. My brother has asthma, he lives in Pune, a funny man, once he..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Did you ever smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, thirty years I smoked, beedis. I stopped eight years back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do not drink alcohol at all. I was a bank clerk, retired now, and bank people are careful, you know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Let me check your vitals, then listen to your chest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, of course. Sunita, hold my shawl."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 138 over 82, pulse 96, oxygen 91 percent, breathing rate 22, temperature 37.2 degrees.",
   "pause": 12
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the oxygen low? My neighbour had oxygen once..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little low for a normal person, but you have COPD. Now deep breaths in and out, mouth open."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Like this? Cough, sorry."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There is wheeze on both sides, and the air entry is reduced at the bottom of both lungs. Your lips are not blue, which is good.",
   "pause": 10
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Quickly, how are your stomach and bowels? And passing urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Stomach is fine, fine. Urine also normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So this looks like a COPD flare-up, probably an infection on top of the old problem. But I cannot rule out fluid on the lungs yet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fluid? In my lungs? My uncle also had fluid and..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please, Mr Rathore, listen. I will order a chest X-ray and blood tests today, and a lung function test, spirometry."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All today? Sunita has to cook lunch at one o'clock."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "X-ray and blood tests today. Spirometry I am booking for next week, reception will give you the date."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And if the swelling in the ankles continues, I might arrange an echocardiogram, a heart scan, to look at the heart."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Heart scan? My heart is strong, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Continue both inhalers as you are, and use the blue one when needed. I want to see you again if you are not better in one week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And if he is worse in the night, doctor? Should I call you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If he cannot speak full sentences, or his lips turn blue, call an ambulance straight away."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, can I bathe in cold water? My grandson says it is good for health."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Warm water is fine, Mr Rathore. Avoid very cold air and keep the windows shut at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I will make sure, doctor. Thank you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. And please come to the wedding also, there will be good food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ha, we shall see. Take care, both of you."
  }
 ],
